This package is written for Starpi. Two of its mechanisms follow ideas of other open-source
projects; no code of theirs is included, and their licenses are kept here as attribution:

1. OpenClaw 2026.9.9, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 OpenClaw Foundation.
   Idea: normalising the stop reasons of different model providers into one small vocabulary
   (src/brain/stop-reasons.js). License text: LICENSES/openclaw-MIT.txt.

2. NemoClaw 0.1.0, Apache License 2.0, Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES.
   Idea: reducing an outbound host to a canonical form and refusing internal addresses (private
   ranges, loopback, link-local and metadata hosts, carrier-grade NAT, unique-local IPv6) before
   any connection (src/egress/hosts.js). License text: LICENSES/nemoclaw-Apache-2.0.txt.
   NemoClaw ships no NOTICE file. "NVIDIA" and "NemoClaw" are trademarks of their owners and are
   named here only to identify the origin of the idea.

Runtime dependency: @anthropic-ai/sdk (MIT License), loaded only when an Anthropic brain is
configured.
